# Canonical fixture: Flat dc circle (joined rounds)
title: Flat dc circle (joined rounds)
terms: US
yarn: worsted-4
hook: 5.0mm
source: original (project fixture)
license: CC0-1.0

Rnd 1: mr, ch 3 (counts as dc), 11 dc in ring, join. (12)
Rnd 2: ch 3 (counts as dc), dc in same st, 2 dc in each st around, join. (24)
Rnd 3: ch 3 (counts as dc), 2 dc in next st, *dc, 2 dc in next st* x11, join. (36)
Rnd 4: ch 3 (counts as dc), dc, 2 dc in next st, *2 dc, 2 dc in next st* x11, join. (48)
Rnd 5: ch 3 (counts as dc), 2 dc, 2 dc in next st, *3 dc, 2 dc in next st* x11, join. (60)
